  "translation": "Today is Sunday. My mother and I go to the supermarket together. The supermarket is to the east of our home. We walk there. Mother can drive, but she does not drive today. We arrive at the supermarket, we first look at the fruit. Mother asks: 'What fruit do you want to eat?' I say: 'I want to eat apples.' This apple is very cheap, one yuan each. Mother asks me how many I want, I say I want five. Then mother buys five apples. We also buy milk, the milk is on the left. We buy two cups of milk, we do not buy bread. After going home, we are all very happy."
